export anchor CircusPosterStyle:
    number: 97
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Circus poster
    idea: The dashboard as a big-top circus bill, with a striped tent crown, figures blazing in starbursts, each project in its own ring and the ringmaster calling out the team's news.
    base: light
    palette:
        canvas: #fdf6e7, the page, panel stripes and tent stripes
        bigTopRed: #b5202e, tent stripes, progress rings, week two poles, ribbons, Behind and overdue
        ringmasterNavy: #1e2a5e, outlines, hard shadows, headings, links and the nav bar
        spotlightGold: #e3a51c, starbursts, pole tops, the current nav pill and the focus halo, never text
        sawdust: #f6e7c4, ring centres and the brand banner
        sawdustEdge: #e7d3a6, the empty ring track and dashed list rules
        showbillInk: #1d1a17, body text
        greasePaint: #3e3a35, meta lines and captions
        ringGreen: #1f6b45, On track
        lionAmber: #8a5300, At risk
    type:
        Display is a heavy slab, Rockwell, Roboto Slab, Clarendon, Bookman
        Old Style, Georgia, serif at 800, often in caps. Text is system-ui,
        Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif. The brand is 40 to 88px red caps, the
        greeting 36 to 60px navy, burst numbers 40 to 64px, ribbon heads 20px
        caps in white, project names 21px, body 15px and tags 12px caps
        tracked 0.12em.
    layout:
        The top is a big-top crown, a triangle of red and cream stripes with
        a navy edge and a gold pennant, with a sawdust banner across it cut
        with swallowtail ends holding the brand and a caps tagline with the
        date. A navy bar holds slab caps nav links, the current one a gold
        pill, a round search field, the bell, a red New project button and
        the user. The greeting is centred, with a red pill warning. The four
        numbers sit inside starbursts, gold, pink, red for overdue and pale
        blue, each with a hard navy shadow. Projects fill a white panel whose
        title is a red ribbon on its top edge, three by two, each a circus
        ring donut showing percent and tasks, with name, team and due, and a
        status pill. Below, a striped pole chart sits beside The ringmaster
        announces, a list with megaphone discs and a red Presenting tag.
        Bursts go two by two below 960px. Rings go two across on phones.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px panel padding and 32px between panels.
    density: Loud and roomy. Few items per panel, each billed large.
    corners: 16px on panels, 12px on buttons, round rings, pills and avatars, swallowtail notches on ribbons and the banner.
    borders: 3px navy outlines on every panel, button, field and ribbon.
    shadows: A hard 5px navy offset with no blur, like a second ink colour.
    icons:
        Chunky solid shapes. A pennant for On track, a diamond for At risk,
        a stop octagon with a bar cut out for Behind and overdue, each in an
        outlined pill with the caps word. A megaphone marks announcements.
    focus: A 3px navy outline offset 3px inside an 8px gold halo. On the navy bar the outline is cream.
    tone: Ringmaster patter with exclamation marks, such as Step right up, Presenting and Hold your breath.
